# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Charles Schwab Frontend - Environment Configuration Template
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# API Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# For PRODUCTION:
#   Set VITE_API_URL=/api and configure your hosting platform
#   (Vercel, Nginx, etc.) to proxy /api/* to your backend.
#   This keeps the backend origin hidden from the browser.
#
# For LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
#   Point directly to backend: http://localhost:3002
#   Or use production backend for testing
VITE_API_URL=/api

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Backend Proxy Target (for local dev only)
# Used by vite.config.ts during development
# Change this to wherever your backend is running locally
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
API_TARGET=http://localhost:3002

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WebSocket Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# For local dev: http://localhost:3002
# For production: Direct backend URL (Vercel can't proxy WebSockets)
VITE_SOCKET_URL=http://localhost:3002

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Production URLs Reference
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frontend: https://charlesschwab-wine.vercel.app
# Admin Panel: https://schwabadmin.vercel.app
# Backend API: https://schwab-dackend-production-4c6c.up.railway.app
